summary.label:
Using Bazar App, you sell and buy online easier and faster than ever.
Divided into two macro-categories, "New Products" and "Used Products", Bazar offers the benefits of an Online Shop to both authorized stores and individuals willing to sell or exchange their second-hand products.

Sell:
- Create your Online Shop and publish an ad in maximum 60 seconds;
- Customize your Shop, describe your activity, add a profile photo, address, contact and your own website.
- Add unlimited products ads in all categories of the App;
- Edit your ad at any time, modify product specifications or apply price reductions;
- Receive "Push" notifications for received orders;
- Receive "Push" notifications for new Chat messages;
- Receive notifications in the App when someone starts following your Shop;
- Manage your orders in a simple menu;
- Mark your sold products, which you want to remain visible;
- Apply discounts and personalize your offers with the labels available in the App;

Buy:
- Customize the products displayed in the App based on your favorite categories;
- Search by categories, subcategories and specific filters;
- Add products to the favorites list for later;
- Follow the Shops that interest you;
- Contact the sellers by chat or phone, directly from the Application;
- Send messages and photos in real time, via Chat;
- Place orders with a single push of a button. Enter your delivery data the first time and for the following orders your data remains saved;
